[00:13.54]1. This is a song, a happy song of vict’ry;
[00:19.20]It magnifies the One who is supreme.
[00:24.48]The words give hope and prompt all to be loyal.
[00:29.90]Come sing with us; enjoy its Kingdom theme:
[00:34.70](Chorus)
[00:34.98]‘Come worship God Before his throne.
[00:40.68]His Son is King; Let’s make it known!
[00:46.48]Come learn this song, this song about the Kingdom;
[00:52.26]Bow down to God, and praise his holy name.’
[01:08.76]2. With this new song, we advertise the Kingdom.
[01:14.34]Christ Jesus rules; the earth is his domain.
[01:19.74]And as foretold, there is a newborn nation:
[01:25.00]The Kingdom heirs, who welcome Jesus’ reign:
[01:29.56](Chorus)
[01:30.16]‘Come worship God Before his throne.
[01:35.86]His Son is King; Let’s make it known!
[01:42.06]Come learn this song, this song about the Kingdom;
[01:47.22]Bow down to God, and praise his holy name.’
[02:12.26]3. This Kingdom song, all humble ones can master.
[02:17.74]The words are clear, their message warm and bright.
[02:22.94]In all the earth, a multitude have learned it,
[02:28.42]And they in turn still others now invite:
[02:32.90](Chorus)
[02:33.60]‘Come worship God Before his throne.
[02:39.14]His Son is King; Let’s make it known!
[02:45.52]Come learn this song, this song about the Kingdom;
[02:50.86]Bow down to God, and praise his holy name.’
